### ==========================================
### ML RECOMMENDATION SERVICE V2 - DIRECT TESTING
### Model: NCB v2 with Adaptive Learning
### Port: 8000 (FastAPI)
### ==========================================

### 1. Health Check - Check if model v2 loaded
GET http://localhost:8000/health
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Root Endpoint - Service Info
GET http://localhost:8000/
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Similar Products - Udang Sedang (from 57 real products)
# Product ID: 7a4af2f2-f55b-4300-a4ba-4406efcc350c
GET http://localhost:8000/v1/recommendations/similar/7a4af2f2-f55b-4300-a4ba-4406efcc350c?top_k=10
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Similar Products - Ayam Kampung (from 57 real products)
# Product ID: 70710b93-2b14-4674-a243-b919d6002c48
GET http://localhost:8000/v1/recommendations/similar/70710b93-2b14-4674-a243-b919d6002c48?top_k=10
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Similar Products - Bawang Merah (from 57 real products)
# Product ID: 8c7b5a2f-1e3d-4f9a-b8c6-3d4e5f6a7b8c
GET http://localhost:8000/v1/recommendations/similar/8c7b5a2f-1e3d-4f9a-b8c6-3d4e5f6a7b8c?top_k=5
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. Bundle Recommendations - Mix Protein & Bumbu
POST http://localhost:8000/v1/recommendations/bundle
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "product_ids": [
    "7a4af2f2-f55b-4300-a4ba-4406efcc350c",
    "8c7b5a2f-1e3d-4f9a-b8c6-3d4e5f6a7b8c"
  ],
  "top_k": 8
}

###

### 7. Trending Products - Top 15
GET http://localhost:8000/v1/recommendations/trending?top_k=15
Accept: application/json

###

### 8. Category Recommendations - Protein Laut
# Category ID: 660e8400-e29b-41d4-a716-446655440001
GET http://localhost:8000/v1/recommendations/category/660e8400-e29b-41d4-a716-446655440001?top_k=10
Accept: application/json

###

### 9. Category Recommendations - Bumbu & Rempah (exclude specific product)
# Category ID: 3
GET http://localhost:8000/v1/recommendations/category/3?top_k=8&exclude_id=8c7b5a2f-1e3d-4f9a-b8c6-3d4e5f6a7b8c
Accept: application/json

###

### 10. Test with Invalid Product ID (Error Handling)
GET http://localhost:8000/v1/recommendations/similar/invalid-product-id?top_k=5
Accept: application/json

###

